   5:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** * Description:
   6:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  The Timer component consists of a 8, 16, 24 or 32-bit timer with
ARM GAS  C:\Users\elias\AppData\Local\Temp\ccet7KRO.s 			page 41


   7:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  a selectable period between 2 and 2^Width - 1.  The timer may free run
   8:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  or be used as a capture timer as well.  The capture can be initiated
   9:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  by a positive or negative edge signal as well as via software.
  10:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  A trigger input can be programmed to enable the timer on rising edge
  11:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  falling edge, either edge or continous run.
  12:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  Interrupts may be generated due to a terminal count condition
  13:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *  or a capture event.
  14:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Timer_3.c **** *
